{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52070","headline":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏 · 岑文本","name":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五材□水流，千流会谷王。\n委输绵厚载，朝宗极大荒。\n浮天纳星汉，浴日吐扶桑。\n奔涛疑叠岛，惊浪似浮航。\n云撤青丘见，雾卷碧流长。\n金台焕霞景，银阙藻春光。\n九夷骄巨壑，五辂出辽阳。\n朝神泛弘舸，鞭石济飞梁。\n曜戈威海□，振楫落星芒。\n幸厕[歌]旅□，极望恧成章。\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「中书令江陵县开国子弘文馆学士臣岑文本上」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑文本","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}